              },
              "datePublished": "2026-10-27",
              "reviewBody": "I've made this as directed several times.  I love it.  Today I'm going to take the plunge and try the recipe with rice in my little rice cooker for one.  I'll use 1/2 c rice and 1 cup of liquid ingredients prepared in the skillet as instructed.  I'll top it with a couple of small salmon fillets.  If it works, I'll try making it in a small pot and put the raw fillets on top to absorb the flavors of the condiments as it steams.  I'll let you know how it goes, but would like your thoughts on the idea.  Am I a nut case crazy lady, or might I have something worth trying?",
